---
permalink: /ai-games/
title: AI Games — Playful Experiments & Indie Discoveries
description: Explore browser games with AI-driven stories and mechanics, plus games whose creators used AI to help build them.
eleventyComputed:
    robots: "{{ 'index, follow' if (games | aiGames | indexableGames | length) >= site.minGamesPerTag else 'noindex, follow' }}"
---
{% extends 'base.njk' %}
{% block adsense %}{% endblock %}
{% set public_games = games | indexableGames %}
{% set all_ai = public_games | aiGames | sortByDateDesc %}
{% set gameplay = public_games | withAiType('ai-gameplay') | sortByDateDesc %}
{% set assisted = public_games | withAiType('ai-assisted') | sortByDateDesc %}
{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <header class="ai-hero">
        <div class="ai-hero__copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">A field guide to machine-made surprises</p>
            <h1 class="display-h1 text-5xl md:text-7xl mt-4">AI, meet play.</h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-paper-70 leading-relaxed mt-6 max-w-2xl">Games where a model listens, answers or judges—and small projects whose creators used AI behind the scenes. Every label links back to the creator's own explanation.</p>
            <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8" aria-label="AI game types">
                <a href="#ai-gameplay" class="ai-jump"><span>AI in play</span><strong>{{ gameplay.length }}</strong></a>
                <a href="#ai-assisted" class="ai-jump"><span>AI-assisted</span><strong>{{ assisted.length }}</strong></a>
            </nav>
        </div>
        <dl class="ai-ledger" aria-label="AI catalogue summary">
            <div><dt>Games</dt><dd>{{ all_ai.length | pad2 }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>AI in play</dt><dd>{{ gameplay.length | pad2 }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>AI-assisted</dt><dd>{{ assisted.length | pad2 }}</dd></div>
            <div class="ai-ledger__note"><dt>Our rule</dt><dd>Creator-stated use only. No guessing from screenshots or marketing language.</dd></div>
        </dl>
    </header>

    <section class="ai-key" aria-labelledby="ai-key-title">
        <p id="ai-key-title" class="eyebrow">How to read the labels</p>
        <div class="ai-key__items">
            <div>{% set game = { ai: { types: ['ai-gameplay'] } } %}{% include 'ai-labels.njk' %}<p>The model participates while you play: it may respond, generate or judge.</p></div>
            <div>{% set game = { ai: { types: ['ai-assisted'] } } %}{% include 'ai-labels.njk' %}<p>The creator says AI helped make code, images, text or sound.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {% for type in ['ai-gameplay', 'ai-assisted'] %}
    {% set group = gameplay if type == 'ai-gameplay' else assisted %}
    <section id="{{ type }}" class="ai-section scroll-mt-24">
        <header class="ai-section__header">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">{{ 'The model is part of the rules' if type == 'ai-gameplay' else 'The tools used to make it' }}</p>
                <h2 class="display-h2 text-3xl md:text-5xl mt-3">{{ 'AI in play' if type == 'ai-gameplay' else 'AI-assisted creation' }}</h2>
            </div>
            <p>{% if type == 'ai-gameplay' %}The game needs AI for part of the experience: shaping a story, understanding language, recognizing a drawing or deciding an answer.{% else %}The game can be conventional at runtime. This label records what its creator disclosed about the production process.{% endif %}</p>
        </header>
        {% if group.length %}
        <div class="ai-list">
            {% for game in group %}{% include 'ai-game-row.njk' %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="ai-empty"><p>No games in this group yet.</p><a href="/submit/" class="link-inline">Send the official link and creator's AI notes.</a></div>
        {% endif %}
    </section>
    {% endfor %}

    <aside class="ai-submit-callout">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Open call</p><h2 class="display-h2 text-2xl md:text-3xl mt-2">Made something unusual?</h2></div>
        <p>Tell us where AI appears, link the creator's explanation, and send players to the original site.</p>
        <a href="/submit/" class="btn-primary">Submit an AI game <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </aside>
</div>
{% endblock %}
